esn’t match.","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"isPublicSuffix","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" — a closure into a Public Suffix List, used to validate that","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the relying-party identifier is a registrable suffix of the origin’s effective","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"domain.","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"enterpriseRpIds","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" — relying-party identifiers allowed to receive","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"platform-managed enterprise attestation. When the request specifies","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/WebAuthn\/AttestationPreference\/enterprise","type":"reference"},{"text":", the client escalates to level 2","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"(platform-managed) for RPs in this set, and uses level 1 (vendor-facilitated)","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"otherwise.","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"allowedExtensions","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" — the set of WebAuthn extensions the client will process.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Anything the relying party requests outside this set is dropped before reaching","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the authenticator. Defaults to ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/WebAuthn\/Extension","type":"reference"},{"text":"’s standard set.","type":"text"}]}]}]},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"PIN and user verification are supplied per ceremony via "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/WebAuthn\/Authorization"},{"type":"text","text":","},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"tex